{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV全新真人騷《輪盤遊戲》目前播至第三集，藍白兩隊駕駛電動車展開激烈城巿追逐戰，雙方為求勝利更互相致電刺 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV全新真人騷《輪盤遊戲》目前播至第三集，藍白兩隊駕駛電動車展開激烈城巿追逐戰，雙方為求勝利更互相致電刺探軍情。34歲神秘嘉賓林千渟突然現身為戰局帶來重大變數，而向來腦筋轉數快的郭嘉駿竟在關鍵任務中跌破眾人眼鏡。這位高材生在某個看似簡單的體能挑戰中意外暴露出致命弱點。</p>\n<h2>《輪盤遊戲》藍白兩隊化身車手鬥智鬥力</h2>\n<p>節目進入第3集電動車挑戰下半部，由邱士縉及雷濠權帶領藍隊陣營，與郭嘉駿所屬白隊繼續駕駛電動車在香港市區穿梭執行艱巨任務。兩隊為求勝利各出奇謀爭奪分數，甚至互相致電對方企圖刺探軍情兼擾亂視線。戰況激烈之際，林千渟突然現身短暫加入藍隊陣營並展現極高義氣，全力協助隊員過關斬將。另一邊廂郭嘉駿發揮出超強記憶力，短時間內極速背出青馬大橋歷史並全數答對問題，令雙方分數一直咬得極緊。</p>\n<h2>雷濠權成最終贏家沈貞巧代白隊轉輪盤</h2>\n<p>經過多個回合龍爭虎鬥，藍隊最終贏得第三集挑戰，雷濠權更幸運獲得生啤家族公仔獎品。雖然沈貞巧因為工作繁忙未能擔任今次常駐主持，但她依然驚喜亮相並代表落敗白隊轉動輪盤，成功為隊友爭取免除懲罰。白隊成員在山頂巧遇網絡創作者阿翔並順利完成任務，可惜最終仍未能後來居上反超前藍隊得分。兩隊在賽事中展現出截然不同競技策略與應變能力。</p>\n<h2>林千渟加盟天下一曾改名彌補五行缺金</h2>\n<p>今集短暫加入藍隊參與錄影並展現極高義氣女嘉賓林千渟，原名林婷，早年憑藉拍攝廣告廣為人知。她自2019年起參演首套劇集《理想國》後便愛上演戲，隨後正式加入古天樂旗下天下一集團成為演員，更曾參演電影《惡行之外》及《我們的18歲》。她在生日前夕聽從風水師傅建議，在名字中加入一個千字以彌補命格中五行缺金問題，期盼新名字能為演藝事業帶來全新突破與發展。</p>\n<h2>網民留言力撐林千渟玩得投入極具綜藝感</h2>\n<p>節目播出後引發大批觀眾熱烈討論，不少人將焦點放在短暫登場客串嘉賓身上。各大社交平台隨即湧現大量討論帖文，網民紛紛留言寫道「林千渟今集表現真係好有義氣」、「估唔到佢玩得咁放」，高度讚揚她在遊戲中展現出截然不同投入度。同時亦有粉絲對白隊逃過一劫感到戲劇性，表示「Ivy神之手救咗成隊白隊」、「郭嘉駿今集雖然輸咗但記性真係好勁」，熱烈討論遊戲細節及各人表現。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569821537838373_13000455266b082e28157c4-1024x959.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"899\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569821537838373_13000455266b082e28157c4-1024x959.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569819697487272_3117528836b082e1569f65.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"726b8181-7861-4cc5-867e-00c01447c781.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569819697487272_3117528836b082e1569f65.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-2339389_9975562276b082eb62337f-1024x928.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"870\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-2339389_9975562276b082eb62337f-1024x928.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamting）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-9454838_17419824666b082ebb4c586-1024x1131.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1060\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-9454838_17419824666b082ebb4c586-1024x1131.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamting）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-461905_21050309426b082ebe9f866-1024x1365.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-461905_21050309426b082ebe9f866-1024x1365.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamting）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-5182772_20200592386b082eb37685b-1024x1280.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-5182772_20200592386b082eb37685b-1024x1280.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lamting）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p> \n\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9e%97%e5%8d%83%e6%b8%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">林千渟</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%bc%aa%e7%9b%a4%e9%81%8a%e6%88%b2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">輪盤遊戲</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%83%ad%e5%98%89%e9%a7%bf/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">郭嘉駿</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3550733\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 26 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:43:59.872236+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1377,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T14:30:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T01:17:38.174599+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:37:29.485758+00:00","content_hash":"66c1b03622dcd62dca08dd4039b152d86587bc9b9fa810f8a2493d0751909596","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}